      "side": 1,
      "message": "Correct me if I\u0027m wrong, but since StatusBarManagerService does a lookup based on the `IBinder` token, it shouldn\u0027t accumulate new disable records if a single caller continually calls `disable(DISABLE_NONE)`, but it should correctly find that existing `DisableRecord`. Right?\n\nThat said, I think the most-correct behavior when a caller sends `DISABLE_NONE` is probably to just remove the record anyway, so this seems like a fine change.",
